{
 "method": "Estimated photon fluence and interaction tallies with a custom analog transport calculation using XCOM coefficients and Klein\u2013Nishina Compton scattering. Electron production was tallied from photon interactions; electron slowing-down fluence was estimated with a CSDA approximation based on ESTAR, with an approximate delta-ray contribution. Dose was estimated near charged-particle equilibrium from collision kerma, and PDD from attenuation and inverse-square scaling. Detailed electron transport, air stopping powers, and track-end corrections were not simulated, so these are best estimates rather than high-precision Monte Carlo results.",
 "data_sources": "Provided /tmp/data/xcom_water.txt (liquid-water photon process coefficients) and /tmp/data/estar_water.txt (liquid-water electron stopping powers and ranges). The water-to-air Spencer\u2013Attix ratio is an approximate standard Co-60-energy value using Bethe/Bragg\u2013Gray stopping-power estimates for air; no air stopping-power table was available.",
